WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The design brief. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Turn a wish into a measurable requirement

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A design brief turns “make it fast” into a measurable target with conditions and a way to verify it.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Hypothetical: “carry two occupants for 20 km” is clearer than “be practical”; add measurable conditions before design.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Requirement rewrite

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Turn a wish into a measurable requirement
